OL,3,ASupreme Court blocks Trump's plan to
OL,4,Arestrict mail-in ballots
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Supreme Court has rejected
OL,7,FPresident Donald Trump's plan to
OL,8,Frestrict voting by mail before
OL,9,FNovember's midterm elections, in a
OL,10,Fsetback for the White House.
OL,12,FThe justices upheld a federal judge's
OL,13,Forder that temporarily blocked the US
OL,14,FPostal Service (USPS) from moving
OL,15,Fforwards with new requirements for
OL,16,Fpostal ballots.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
