OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASupreme Court blocks Trump's plan to
OL,4,Arestrict mail-in ballots
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut it is unlikely to be the final word
OL,7,Fon the matter. Justice Brett Kavanaugh,
OL,8,Fa conservative, agreed with the ruling,
OL,9,Fbut indicated he might later rule in
OL,10,FTrump's favour as litigation in the
OL,11,Fcase continues.
OL,13,FTrump, who argued the rules would
OL,14,Fcombat electoral fraud, signed an
OL,15,Fexecutive order in March directing the
OL,16,FUSPS to deliver ballots only to voters
OL,17,Fon lists of citizens.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
